#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:631
msgid "Font Hinting"
msgstr "Penyesuaian Font"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:632
msgctxt "Font hinting"
msgid "off"
msgstr "mati"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:632
msgctxt "Font hinting"
msgid "native"
msgstr "asli"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:632
msgctxt "Font hinting"
msgid "auto"
msgstr "otomatis"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:638
msgid ""
"Font hinting is the process by which fonts are adjusted for maximum "
"readability on the screen's pixel grid.\n"
"\n"
"- off: no hinting.\n"
"- native: use the font internal hinting instructions.\n"
"- auto: use FreeType's hinting algorithm, ignoring font instructions."
msgstr ""
"Hinting huruf adalah proses penyesuaian huruf agar tetap mudah dibaca pada "
"kisi piksel layar.\n"
"\n"
"• Mati: tanpa hinting.\n"
"• Asli: menggunakan instruksi hinting bawaan yang terdapat di dalam font.\n"
"• Otomatis: menggunakan algoritma hinting FreeType dan mengabaikan instruksi "
"yang terdapat di dalam font."

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:646
msgid "Font Kerning"
msgstr "Kerning font"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:647
msgctxt "Font kerning"
msgid "off"
msgstr "mati"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:647
msgctxt "Font kerning"
msgid "fast"
msgstr "cepat"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:647
msgctxt "Font kerning"
msgid "good"
msgstr "bagus"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:647
msgctxt "Font kerning"
msgid "best"
msgstr "terbaik"

#: frontend/ui/data/creoptions.lua:653
msgid ""
"Font kerning is the process of adjusting the spacing between individual "
"letter forms, to achieve a visually pleasing result.\n"
"\n"
"- off: no kerning.\n"
"- fast: use FreeType's kerning implementation (no ligatures).\n"
"- good: use HarfBuzz's light kerning implementation (faster than best but no "
"ligatures and limited support for non-western scripts)\n"
"- best: use HarfBuzz's full kerning implementation (slower, but may support "
"ligatures with some fonts; also needed to properly display joined arabic "
"glyphs and some other scripts).\n"
"\n"
"(Font Hinting may need to be adjusted for the best result with either "
"kerning implementation.)"
msgstr ""
"Kerning font adalah proses penyesuaian jarak antarhuruf untuk menghasilkan "
"tampilan teks yang lebih nyaman dibaca.\n"
"\n"
"• Mati: tanpa kerning.\n"
"• Cepat: menggunakan implementasi kerning FreeType (tanpa ligatur).\n"
"• Baik: menggunakan implementasi kerning ringan HarfBuzz (lebih cepat "
"daripada Terbaik, tetapi tanpa ligatur dan dukungan terbatas untuk aksara "
"non-Barat).\n"
"• Terbaik: menggunakan implementasi kerning penuh HarfBuzz (lebih lambat, "
"tetapi dapat mendukung ligatur pada beberapa font; juga diperlukan agar glif "
"Arab yang saling tersambung dan beberapa aksara lainnya ditampilkan dengan "
"benar).\n"
"\n"
"(Untuk hasil terbaik, Anda mungkin perlu menyesuaikan Hinting font sesuai "
"implementasi kerning yang digunakan.)"

