#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:177
msgid "Widows and orphans"
msgstr "Baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman"

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:179
msgid "About widow and orphan lines"
msgstr "Tentang baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman"

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:180
msgid ""
"Widows and orphans are lines at the beginning or end of a paragraph, which "
"are left dangling at the top or bottom of a page, separated from the rest of "
"the paragraph.\n"
"The first line of a paragraph alone at the bottom of a page is called an "
"orphan line.\n"
"The last line of a paragraph alone at the top of a page is called a widow "
"line.\n"
"\n"
"Some people (and publishers) don't like widows and orphans, and can avoid "
"them with CSS rules.\n"
"To avoid widows and orphans, some lines have to be pushed to the next page "
"to accompany what would otherwise be widows and orphans. This may leave some "
"blank space at the bottom of the previous page, which might be more "
"disturbing to others.\n"
"\n"
"The default is to allow widows and orphans.\n"
"These tweaks allow you to change this behavior, and to override publisher "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman adalah baris pada awal atau akhir "
"paragraf yang terpisah dari paragrafnya karena berada sendiri di bagian atas "
"atau bawah halaman.\n"
"Baris pertama paragraf yang berada sendiri di bagian bawah halaman disebut "
"**baris terpisah di akhir halaman**.\n"
"Baris terakhir paragraf yang berada sendiri di bagian atas halaman disebut "
"**baris terpisah di awal halaman**.\n"
"\n"
"Sebagian orang (dan penerbit) tidak menyukai tampilan seperti ini sehingga "
"menghindarinya menggunakan aturan CSS.\n"
"Untuk mencegah baris terpisah di awal atau akhir halaman, beberapa baris "
"harus dipindahkan ke halaman berikutnya agar tetap menyatu dengan "
"paragrafnya. Akibatnya, bagian bawah halaman sebelumnya mungkin menyisakan "
"ruang kosong, yang bagi sebagian orang justru terasa lebih mengganggu.\n"
"\n"
"Secara bawaan, baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman diizinkan.\n"
"Pengaturan ini memungkinkan Anda mengubah perilaku tersebut serta "
"mengabaikan aturan yang ditetapkan oleh penerbit."

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:201
msgid "Avoid widows and orphans"
msgstr "Hindari baris terpisah"

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:202
msgid ""
"Avoid widow and orphan lines, allowing for some possible blank space at the "
"bottom of pages."
msgstr ""
"Hindari baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman dengan kemungkinan "
"menyisakan ruang kosong di bagian bawah halaman."

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:215
msgid "Avoid widows but allow orphans"
msgstr ""
"Hindari baris terpisah di awal halaman, tetapi izinkan baris terpisah di "
"akhir halaman"

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:216
msgid ""
"Avoid widow lines, but allow orphan lines, allowing for some possible blank "
"space at the bottom of pages.\n"
"Allowing orphans avoids ambiguous blank space at the bottom of a page, which "
"could otherwise be confused with real spacing between paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"Hindari baris terpisah di awal halaman, tetapi izinkan baris terpisah di "
"akhir halaman, dengan kemungkinan menyisakan ruang kosong di bagian bawah "
"halaman.\n"
"Mengizinkan baris terpisah di akhir halaman menghindari ruang kosong yang "
"membingungkan di bagian bawah halaman, yang dapat disalahartikan sebagai "
"jarak antarparagraf."

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:231
msgid "Ignore publisher orphan and widow rules"
msgstr ""
"Abaikan aturan penerbit tentang baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman"

#: frontend/ui/data/css_tweaks.lua:232
msgid "Disable orphan and widow rules specified in embedded styles."
msgstr ""
"Nonaktifkan aturan baris terpisah di awal dan akhir halaman yang ditentukan "
"dalam gaya bawaan dokumen."

