#: plugins/coverimage.koplugin/main.lua:474
msgid ""
"This plugin saves a book cover to a file. That file can then be used as a "
"screensaver on certain devices.\n"
"\n"
"If enabled, the cover image of the current file is stored in the set path on "
"book opening. Books can be excluded if desired.\n"
"\n"
"If disabled, the cover file will be deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If fallback is enabled, the fallback file will be copied to the screensaver "
"file on book closing.\n"
"If the filename is empty or the file doesn't exist, the cover file will be "
"deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If fallback is disabled, the screensaver image will stay in place after "
"closing a book."
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini menyimpan sampul buku ke dalam file. File tersebut dapat "
"digunakan sebagai screensaver pada perangkat tertentu.\n"
"\n"
"Jika diaktifkan, sampul buku akan disimpan pada lokasi yang ditentukan saat "
"membuka buku. Buku dapat dikecualikan jika diinginkan.\n"
"\n"
"Jika dinonaktifkan, file sampul akan dihapus.\n"
"\n"
"Jika fallback diaktifkan, file fallback akan dipindahkan ke file screensaver "
"saat menutup buku.\n"
"Jika nama file kosong atau file tidak ada, file sampul akan dihapus.\n"
"\n"
"Jika fallback dinonaktifkan, gambar screensaver akan tetap berada di "
"tempatnya setelah menutup buku."

#: plugins/coverimage.koplugin/main.lua:486
msgid ""
