#: plugins/wallabag.koplugin/main.lua:564
msgid ""
"Download folder: use a folder that is exclusively used by the Wallabag "
"plugin. Existing files in this folder risk being deleted.\n"
"\n"
"Articles marked as finished, on hold or 100% read can be marked as read (or "
"deleted) on the server. This is done automatically when retrieving new "
"articles with the 'Auto-upload article statuses when downloading' setting.\n"
"\n"
"The 'Delete remotely archived and deleted articles locally' option will "
"allow deletion of local files that are archived or deleted on the server."
msgstr ""
"Folder unduhan: gunakan folder yang dikhususkan untuk plugin Wallabag. File "
"yang sudah ada di dalam folder ini berisiko terhapus.\n"
"\n"
"Artikel yang ditandai sebagai selesai, terjeda, atau telah dibaca 100% dapat "
"ditandai sebagai sudah dibaca (atau dihapus) di server. Hal ini dilakukan "
"secara otomatis saat mengambil artikel baru dengan mengaktifkan pengaturan "
"'Unggah status artikel secara otomatis saat mengunduh'.\n"
"\n"
"Opsi 'Hapus artikel yang terarsip online dan artikel yang dihapus di lokal' "
"memungkinkan penghapusan file lokal yang telah diarsipkan atau dihapus di "
"server."

